	(text "USB-C 2.0 interface is protected from\nESD through TVS diode array, and\nfiltered using ferrite bead and low\nESR ceramic capacitors.\n\nInrush current is limited by soft-start\nand current limiting IC; current limit\nis set by external resistor."
